    "updated_at": "2017-10-31T17:00:07Z",
    "body": "FWIW, it is a common practice in the spec to specify simple rather than optimal algorithms.  For example, the first step of CanvasPattern.setTransform is: \"Create an infinite transparent black bitmap\".",
